WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.710
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.570
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.050
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.050
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.410
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.920
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:44.370
I'm back again today.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:47.830
I'm the evil genius Dr. Eggman!

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:51.880
I will finally take over this world. I'm not kidding!

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:54.550
You'll be in big trouble!

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:59.390
Surrender and do what I say!

00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:05.600
Dr. Eggman, you should give up.

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:09.600
He's right. That fool isn't coming back.

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:14.650
You never know! He may be heading this way right now!

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:18.780
You don't know when to give up. He chose the other world instead of this one.

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:20.660
He's cold-hearted.

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:22.830
He was stupid all along!

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:24.620
I'm turning up the volume!

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:28.290
I'm really going to take over the world! Are you okay with that?

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:30.120
I'm gonna do it! Show yourself!

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:32.670
Sonic!

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:37.690
Episode 52

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:37.690
Memories of the Wind

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:40.800
Thank you!

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:43.970
My mom's milk tea is excellent, Amy.

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:45.970
Have some cake, too.

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:48.350
Thank you.

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:52.900
It's really good.

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:55.820
I'm happy that you like it.

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:03.370
So did you think about what we discussed?

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:08.540
Thank you. I was really happy.

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:13.210
"Was"? That's not good! You have to live here with us!

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:14.420
Cream.

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:15.540
Thank you.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:19.260
But I'm fine.

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:24.550
I really did give it a lot of thought.

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:27.890
I made my decision. I-

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:31.560
Hello again! It's Dr. Eggman!

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:43.160
Since the moon is beautiful tonight, I'm going to talk all night about my plans for building the Eggman Empire!

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:46.030
I won't stop until the morning!

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:47.240
Fever!

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:48.660
He really said it.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:50.410
What's "fever"?

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.210
How should I know?

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:54.790
What was that?

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:56.750
Did someone attack us?

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:02.380
Amy's hammer is stuck into the ship!

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:05.470
How dangerous! It almost hit us!

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:06.720
There she is!

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:08.100
What are you doing?

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:09.720
You could've hurt us!

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:11.390
Stop messing around!

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:15.480
Don't you know what time it is? Be considerate!

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:17.770
What? You fool!

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:20.480
I can't be a villain if I'm considerate!

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:21.610
That's right!

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.700
Dr. Eggman is right!

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.780
Yeah! I know I'm right!

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:30.700
Just because Sonic hasn't returned, don't take it out on us, you dummy!

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:40.340
Amy, please calm down.

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:42.470
Dr. Eggman...

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:43.760
She's mad!

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:45.800
Would you like to apologize?

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:49.350
Humph! She's not the only one who's annoyed!

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:54.270
It doesn't matter if you're angry because your hammer is stuck up here!

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:57.100
She has another one!

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:58.730
How many does she have?

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:00.110
No way!

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:02.940
You're really going to attack us over such a tiny disagreement?

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:04.860
Shut up!

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:05.740
Come down here!

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:06.990
I'm not coming down!

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:08.450
It's not our fault!

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:11.330
That's right! It's not our fault that he dumped you!

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:12.700
I wasn't dumped!

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:16.460
She's right. You can't be dumped if you weren't dating in the first place!

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:19.790
They're both at fault.

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:22.510
It's helping relieve their frustration.

00:05:22.510 --> 00:05:27.220
You think so? I think they're getting more annoyed.

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:31.760
So what do you really think?

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:36.640
Do you think Sonic isn't coming home?

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:41.400
I don't have an opinion.

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:43.650
That's hard to believe.

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:48.990
He didn't warp at the same time as us.

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:52.410
But even taking the time lag between the two worlds into account, he should be here by now.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:54.790
Things don't always go smoothly.

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:57.540
What if it's the other way around?

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:00.750
A week here may be decades over there.

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:02.210
He could be a geezer.

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:05.880
Ouch! What was that for?

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:07.930
I'm being serious!

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:11.100
What's with the "Things don't always go smoothly" attitude?

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:16.730
You should say, "You're right. He'll be back soon. Thank you, Rouge. You're beautiful and kind".

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:19.850
Then you give me a few jewels as a present!

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:21.560
What are you talking about!

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:23.360
You annoy me!

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:29.030
When I see you staring at the moon every night, waiting for Sonic to return, it makes me sad too!

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:30.570
Don't be silly!

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:33.700
I'm not staring at the moon and thinking about him!

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:35.540
You must be thinking about him!

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:37.200
Screw Kick!

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:49.880
I understand. If you miss him so much, stop bothering me and go to the other world!

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:53.760
You should go back to elementary school!

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:57.100
And take a course on how women feel!

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:59.230
You stupid echidna!

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:03.190
You thick-headed rugrat!

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:09.530
How dare you disturb me in the middle of the night, Eggman!

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:13.070
How rude! I have trouble sleeping!

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:14.870
And what's with that outfit?

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:16.910
Did you just crawl out of bed?

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:19.660
Just when I managed to fall asleep!

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:22.500
He's also in a bad mood.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:23.830
What a punk.

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:27.670
Dr. Eggman, let's pick on him to take our mind off things.

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:29.380
That's a good idea.

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:33.760
But we should change venues first.

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.470
That's the deal, Tails.

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:37.890
Follow us!

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:40.430
What do you mean by "That's the deal"?

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:42.350
Stop asking questions every single time!

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:45.610
How dare you run away!

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:51.530
Amy, come inside.

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:59.750
This place is fine.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:01.580
Come on, Tails. Bring-

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:07.290
You're not supposed to attack until I finish saying, "Bring it on!"

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:09.800
He's turning into a violent thug.

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:14.390
We have to punish and stop him before he turns evil!

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:16.140
We're the ones who're going to do that? Doesn't sound right...

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:18.140
Shoot him down!

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:21.060
I won't lose!

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:23.980
Tornado, super maneuverability mode!

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:29.650
What's this?

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:32.530
How are you, Tails?

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:35.780
You must be in trouble if you pressed the transformation button.

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:42.410
Don't worry. The canopy is made of special glass that's tougher than X-Tornado's.

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:49.710
Ever since I found out that you were leaving, I wanted to give you a special present.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:55.180
But I wasn't up with the latest trends, and I was a little embarrassed.

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:58.350
So I decided to do this in secret.

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:01.680
This is my present. I hope you like it.

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:02.980
Chuck...

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:06.020
Change into Hyper Tornado!

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:13.530
It controls the same as X-Tornado. Good luck, Tails!

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:15.650
Here I go, Chuck!

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:17.110
What's that?

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:18.870
That's a major transformation.

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:20.910
How can it transform into that shape?

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:22.290
It's not logical.

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:24.080
Z-Beam!

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:27.460
Macro Missile!

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:31.130
Plasma Fire!

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:33.210
Oh my!

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:36.590
I wasn't scared! I was faking it!

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:38.760
Your weapons don't work against us.

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:41.060
Amy's hammer was more impressive!

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:43.470
It's because that plane is a 20th century model.

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:48.060
Show him our 21st century super weapon!

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:50.150
Roger!

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:54.320
Launch interceptor missile!

00:09:57.320 --> 00:10:00.450
I'll dodge it!

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.120
It can't be fooled by heat or light.

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:07.080
In that case...

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:13.380
Go!

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:18.380
Now!

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:27.140
You fool! That may work in other cartoons, but not this one!

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:30.730
It would be too convenient if you were the only one able to dodge it.

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:39.030
Tails, we programmed this missile with your data. It won't explode if it hits something else.

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:41.950
You have to give up!

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:44.080
You're perfect, Dr. Eggman!

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:46.370
That is the ultimate super weapon.

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:48.330
You really think so?

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:54.630
Damn! It's over for me!

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:56.670
I hope you learned your lesson.

00:10:56.670 --> 00:11:00.840
Don't show up when I'm in bad mood.

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:05.350
I forgive you. Decoe, have the missile self-destruct.

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:09.390
C'mon now, press the self-destruct button.

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:15.980
You don't look so good. What's wrong?

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:17.860
There isn't one.

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:20.490
What did you say? Speak louder.

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:21.360
There isn't one!

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:23.450
What? You didn't install it?

00:11:23.570 --> 00:11:26.870
So that missile can't self-destruct?

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:29.040
What are you going to do? It's going to hit him!

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:30.870
Yes, it will.

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:33.540
Tails is going to die today!

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:36.980
<i>Sign: It's over~!</i>

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:39.880
It's over for me.

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:00.400
Sonic!

00:12:16.710 --> 00:12:19.880
You guys never change.

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:25.550
That's right. We don't.

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:30.390
I won't forgive you, Eggman!

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:32.390
Be quiet, Sonic!

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:34.940
You always interfere with my plans!

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:36.480
I'll get you today!

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:42.650
Just you wait!

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:52.290
Sonic!

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:56.040
He always leaves quickly.

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:02.670
Sonic defeated us again!

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:04.880
He's always in our way.

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:08.510
At this rate, we'll never be able to conquer the world.

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:11.180
Dr. Eggman.

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:13.930
Why are you smiling?

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:17.350
You're weirding me out! Shouldn't you be frustrated?

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:20.730
Oh yeah. I'm frustrated.

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:28.740
Ouch!

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:30.370
How's that?

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:33.160
Did that hurt?

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:37.250
Whatever! That's not enough to hurt me!

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:40.710
That's...

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:44.380
Ouch.

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:49.640
I feel stupid. Why are we acting like this?

00:13:51.050 --> 00:13:53.180
You look terrible.

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:55.600
You!

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:57.480
Stop it!

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:00.560
Be quiet, you echidna!

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:01.650
I give up!

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:22.340
<b>Kimi ga boku no namae wo</b>

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:22.340
<i>You called my name</i>

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:26.940
<b>Hajimete yonda natsu no hi</b>

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:26.940
<i>For the first time on a summer day</i>

00:14:26.940 --> 00:14:32.640
<b>Boku wa kimi wo ai shi hajimeteta</b>

00:14:26.940 --> 00:14:32.640
<i>I began to fall in love with you</i>

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:39.310
<b>Ano yoru kimi wa heya ni inai</b>

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:39.310
<i>That night you weren't in your room</i>

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:43.710
<b>Demo boku wa nanimo kikanai</b>

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:43.710
<i>but I do not ask you anything</i>

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:49.400
<b>Tada kimi wo hana sena kunatte ita</b>

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:49.400
<i>I could not be apart from you</i>

00:14:51.970 --> 00:14:55.910
<b>Dareka no tame no...</b>

00:14:51.970 --> 00:14:55.910
<i>For someone's sake...</i>

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:57.910
Sonic? What took you so long!

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:59.920
<b>...kimi no kako wa...</b>

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:59.920
<i>...hide your past...</i>

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:07.860
<b>...tokai no zawameki ni kakushite</b>

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:07.860
<i>...in the noise of the city</i>

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:16.490
<b>Todoke (todoke) kokoro (kokoro) ashita made</b>

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:16.490
<i>Hold on to my heart until tomorrow</i>

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:24.700
<b>Semete aki ga owaru made</b>

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:24.700
<i>At least until the end of autumn</i>

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:32.820
<b>Itsumo (itsumo) ai wa (ai wa) yureteru kara</b>

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:32.820
<i>Because love is always wavering</i>

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:40.200
<b>Kokoro wo tojite daremo soko he wa irenaide</b>

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:40.200
<i>Seal your heart and place no one else there</i>

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:44.330
<b>Doushitemo ima kore kara</b>

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:44.330
<i>By any means possible</i>

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:48.630
<b>Ano umi he tsurete itte</b>

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:48.630
<i>Please accompany me to that sea</i>

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:55.300
<b>Yagate sora wa shiroku akete yuku</b>

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:55.300
<i>The sky will soon turn white at dawn</i>

